!/main_round/anonymization/team10/S/S1/submission/team10_S1_defense.zip
# User authorized uploading the completed S2 state, including its submission ZIP, to private main.
!/main_round/anonymization/team10/S/S2/submission/team10_S2_defense.zip
# User explicitly authorized the R1 token-bearing ZIP in this private repository on 2026-09-17.
!/main_round/anonymization/team10/R/R1/submission/team10_R1_defense.zip
# User requested storing the submitted R2 ZIP under R2 in this private repository on 2026-09-17.
!/main_round/anonymization/team10/R/R2/submission/team10_R2_defense.zip
# User requested storing R3, including its submission ZIP, in this private repository.
!/main_round/anonymization/team10/R/R3/submission/team10_R3_defense.zip
# User requested storing R4, including its submission ZIP, in this private repository.
